  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical consultancy for NIPP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specialized technical consultancy supporting implementation of the Norwegian Indigenous Peoples Programme (NIPP) in Brazil, for the period of March 2024 to February 2026. The consultancy will further enhace and qualify the technical assistance the Embassy provides to Brazilian Indigenous Peoples organizations and associations that receives funding from NIPP. NIPP  centers around building capacity within indigenous representative organizations and securing Indigenous Peoples the rights and means to protect their lands. The gender perspective is a strong component within the Programme, NIPP always looking to strengthen female participation within the indigenous associations and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
